<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's forint closes weaker vs dollar.</title>
<headline>Hungary's forint closes weaker vs dollar.</headline>
<text>
<p>1040 GMT - Hungary's forint closed the Friday session slightly weaker against the dollar as it followed movements in the dollar/mark cross on international markets, dealers said.</p>
<p>* As the market closed for the weekend the Hungarian unit stood right on the central bank bid at 155.68/73, compared to an opening of 155.53/59.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
